('unalive', 'unalive', 'Algospeak for "kill" or "suicide", used to avoid content filters', 'YELLOW', 'Can be about a video game or a show, or about self-harm. Context decides.', 'Ask what they were talking about. If it is about themselves, call or text 988 together.', 'KNOWN', true, true),
('sewerslide', 'sewerslide', 'Algospeak for "suicide"', 'YELLOW', 'Used to talk about suicide without triggering filters.', 'Ask calmly what the conversation was about. If it is about them, call or text 988.', 'KNOWN', true, true),
