('nudes', 'nudes', 'Nude photos', 'RED', 'Requests for nudes are the first step of sextortion scams that target teens.', 'Tell them: if anyone asks or threatens them, they will never be in trouble with you. Report at tips.fbi.gov.', 'KNOWN', true, true),
